Title: Here I Am, Send Me
Author: Ida Möller
Key: [C]
CCLI: 7003233
Notes: Unofficial English translation of "Här är jag sänd mig" (../worship-swedish). Syllable counts and stresses follow the Swedish so the chords sit where they did.

Verse 1:
[C]Here I am, send me [C/E]
[F]Here I [C/E]am, send me[Gsus] [G]
[Am]Here [G/B]I [C]am, [Dm]send [C/E]me
[F]I will [C/G]go where You're [F/G]leading [C]me

Verse 2:
[C]I will follow You [C/E]
[F]I will [C/E]follow You [Gsus] [G]
[Am]I [G/B]will [C]fol[Dm]low [C/E]You
[F]I will [C/G]go where You're [F/G]leading [C]me

Key Change (D):
[D]Your will be done in me [D/F#]
[G]Your will be [D/F#]done in me [Asus] [A]
[Bm]Your will [A/C#]be [D]done [Em]in [D/F#]me
[G]I will [D/A]go where You're [G/A]leading [D]me

Key Change (E):
[E]Jesus, hear my prayer [E/G#]
[A]Jesus, [E/G#]hear my [Bsus]prayer [B]
[C#m]Je[B/D#]sus, [E]hear [F#m]my [E/G#]prayer
[A]I will [E/B]go where You're [A/B]leading [C#m]me

Ending:
[A]I am [E/B]ready to [A/B]serve You, [C#m]Lord
[A]I will [E/B]go where You're [A/B]leading [E]me
